{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-15_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-15","title":"冬逝","storyCode":"6-17","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"091b63b91abc6f3e7dc56d60b1c41bde3fcf928c0b734823b5e50e5647cfe5e9","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"霜星永遠地閉上了雙眼。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_9"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"碎了......嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺子從某個巫師那裡求得這樣東西......說是能維持住我的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"連一場戰鬥都沒撐過去，呵呵，終歸，還是假貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"也許就像我們父女一樣......？和現在的，荒誕的整合運動......也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......煌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"寒流已經......消散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事！阿米婭，快，去看看那隻白兔子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"贏得漂亮，羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的兄弟姐妹們......我讓他們白白死去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我們什麼都沒做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的生命......一點價值都沒有。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們是因為你的理念而追隨你的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的死......不值得任何人久留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"去救你們還能救的人吧。趕快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"快去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是阻止那些穿雨衣的，還是去追殺梅菲斯特，還是收容那些無處可去的感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。去做有價值的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我留下。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你去吧。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，請告訴霜星小姐那句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......拜託你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"真是隻......天真的兔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"很像啊。和當時的塔露拉，很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"在死前能看到這樣的人，這樣堅定地去實現理想的人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"說好的責任呢？！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"不是答應說要加入羅德島的嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"憑你的頭腦，應該也考慮到這點了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"壞人也要有壞人該有的樣子。我對自己應得的結局毫無怨言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我傷害了你們，我和整合運動把目標對準了無辜的龍門人，一手促成了烏薩斯感染者的黑暗未來，這樣的人根本沒資格去羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的兄弟姐妹......這些傻子，一定是想著讓我活著吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"本以為哪怕這一次我死去了，這些傻子也能因此得到個允許他們活下去的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，並沒有。他們死了。為了保護我這個本來就沒多少時間的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我不甘心。我們的性命全都被人利用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我不甘心......這最後一刻的生命，這一點不屬於我，這是他們所有人用血去換來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"這一點點生命.......我必須交給值得信任的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":".......啊......即使活下來了，又有哪裡可去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我們本就沒有其它地方可去。我們熟悉的從來就只有那片雪原而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門並不是烏薩斯。渴望著拯救同胞和感染者，想要去找一處又溫暖，又有糧食，還有住處的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"不該是龍門。自一開始，就不該是龍門。龍門的市民也在苦苦尋求自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我們唯一該回去的，就只有烏薩斯......我們的祖國......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"雪......靜靜的河水......搖曳的松林......碧綠的苔衣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地，多麼美好啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以，你認為塔露拉是操縱了這一切的人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我猜的沒錯......陰謀已經蓄勢待發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"就算博卓卡斯替老爺子能拖上一時，塔露拉既然敢這樣謀劃，就一定有對付他的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門沒有出手的機會......而烏薩斯也會袖手旁觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"但你們還在，感染者還有機會。哪怕只有一點點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"——去毀掉現在的塔露拉。中止她的瘋狂，不要讓整合運動再吞噬更多感染者了。整合運動不需要塔露拉，任何一個塔露拉都不需要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"或者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的一點點私心。去拯救她。不。去幫助她。和我們那無數的感染者同胞一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"那個真正的......走在泥濘土地上的......塔露拉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"霜星小姐？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你......說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我認為你父親是真的愛你的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就像你記得你的親生父母為你而死。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你清楚地記著你父親為你所做的一切。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我又怎麼會不知道呢？只是，我要死在他之前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他從來沒撿到我，那會有多好。那樣，他就不會因我感到痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"他已經受了那麼多的苦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"正因為他受過很多苦，所以他才珍惜你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以這麼叫你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的博士。在這片大地上，選擇也許沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"即使這樣，即使結果沒有區別......我也想自己去選。我做出選擇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"用我自己的手......去擦拭我結出的果。"},{"type":"narration","text":"霜星的手指摸索著你的面龐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......你的手指，是暖的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪。你的臉......很冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的體溫......沒有那麼低了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是。你的病徵消失了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"很溫暖，霜星。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......在死前......我終於又和人相碰了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"霜星，阿米婭和我都希望你加入羅德島。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我真有這種資格？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"僅僅是普通地死去，就沒有時間再去改正錯誤。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......不給出答覆是不禮貌的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴阿米婭，Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"在這片大地上，僅憑一個人，是什麼也做不到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_10_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"但她絕對不是一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"現在開始，我在你身邊。我在你們身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我......願意加入羅德島。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"謝謝你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"不。是我......謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼神......和我一位舊識，很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我遇見過一個男孩，他說他的哥哥寧願上絞架也不願改變觀點去迎合敵人的寬恕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"所以他要走過雪原，他要踏遍烏薩斯.......所以他沒有和我們一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為那已經是我見過最理想化的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你和阿米婭讓我覺得……也許理想也可以成為一種信念。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"羅德島就是為了共同的信念而戰的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"原本整合運動......也是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"真像啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼神，和那個孩子，真的很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，你沒他那麼堅定，但卻比他......溫柔太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"放手吧。兄弟姐妹們在等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......父親......我真是個傻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"原諒我吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"她滑落下去。\n她的嘴角上揚，高傲得像是依然還活著一般。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]}]}
